{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56913","headline":"谷城石人腹谶文 · 佚名","name":"谷城石人腹谶文","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摩兜鞬，真勿言。\n（见宋苏颂《苏魏公集》卷五《累年告老恩旨未俞……》诗注引，幷云：「唐刘洎少尝遇异人，谓之曰：『君当佐太平得富贵，然宜慎兜鞬之戒。\n』洎後爲侍中，以议论不常获谴。\n」刘洎，唐太宗时人）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}